subckt Main (VDD VSS Vout)
C1 (VDD Vout) capacitor c=1p
C2 (net2 VSS) capacitor c=1p
C3 (net0 VSS) capacitor c=1p
I1 (VDD net2) isource dc=100u
L1 (VDD Vout) inductor l=1n
L2 (net0 VSS) inductor l=1n
M1 (net3 net2 net0 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (Vout VDD net3 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M3 (net2 net2 VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
R1 (VDD Vout) resistor r=1k
R2 (net0 net1) resistor r=1k
R3 (VDD Vout) resistor r=1k
R4 (net0 VSS) resistor r=1k
V1 (net1 VSS) vsource dc=1.8
